We are just callin rmdir. I can not assess if the directory was actually removed or not. A good test scenario must check the functionnal consequences of the operation performed. So the right formal test is not just calling `rmdir(name)` it is:
- creating a directory
- checking it is here
- removing the directory *the target functionnal action*
- checking it is not here.

